			"caption": "Each toast has a thin bar in its level's color at its left edge: red on the top card for an error, yellow on the two below for warnings. Then come a title, a message and links to the Problems panel, the Console or the Activity panel.",
			"alt": "The editor's Scene view with three toast cards stacked at its right. The first has a red bar and says that the script build failed, with the links Show Problems and Show in Console. The other two have yellow bars: a command script discarded unsaved changes, with Show in Activity and Recover, and a command script deleted an asset, with Show in Activity.",
